<title>JAPAN: MOF says to auction 4-year JGB on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>MOF says to auction 4-year JGB on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance (MOF) plans to offer four-year government notes through a price-competitive auction on Tuesday, a MOF official said on Monday.</p>
<p>Traders said the offer volume is likely to be 500 billion yen, unchanged from the previous offer of four-year notes.</p>
<p>The MOF last auctioned four-year notes on April 1, when it offered 500 billion yen worth of 1.1 percent notes.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-33432-8570</p>
</text>
